# A conflict total is not a declaration: each conflict is declared on its
# own line of an @conflicts block, so `@conflicts = N` is a syntax error.
# error: conflicts_count.grammar:13:12:
# error: syntax error: unexpected symbol '='
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err
@parser
@conflicts = 0
top! = IDENT                                → (top 1)
